8-%EC%8A%A4%ED%94%BC%EC%96%B4%EC%99%80-%EA%B5%AC%EB%A6%84-%EB%B0%B0%EC%B9%98%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","kind":"section","abstract":[{"text":"캐싱해 둔 하늘과 구름 템플릿을 실제 3D 공간에 배치할 차례입니다. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RealityView"},{"text":"로","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"사용자를 감싸는 하늘을 만들고, 여러 구름에 서로 다른 모양과 움직임을 부여합니다.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/Chapter3-ImmersiveView#%ED%95%98%EB%8A%98-%EC%8A%A4%ED%94%BC%EC%96%B4%EC%99%80-%EA%B5%AC%EB%A6%84-%EB%B0%B0%EC%B9%98%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","type":"section","title":"하늘 스피어와 구름 배치하기","role":"pseudoSymbol"},"doc://2026TechMap_tutorial/tutorials/2026TechMap_tutorial/Chapter5-OvertheCloudApp":{"kind":"project","estimatedTime":"5min","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"마지막으로 지금까지 만든 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppModel"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContentView"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ImmersiveView"},{"type":"text","text":"를 하나의"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"앱으로 연결합니다. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":"과 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ImmersiveSpace"},{"type":"text","text":"를 Scene으로 등록하고,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"완전 몰입("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"full"},{"type":"text","text":") 스타일을 지정합니다."}],"role":"project","type":"topic","title":"앱 진입점 구성하기","url":"\/tutorials\/2026techmap_tutorial\/chapter5-overthecloudapp","identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/Chapter5-OvertheCloudApp"},"doc://2026TechMap_tutorial/tutorials/2026TechMap_tutorial/3.---------------":{"kind":"article","abstract":[],"role":"article","type":"topic","title":"3. 에셋 프리로딩 캐시 만들기","url":"\/tutorials\/2026techmap_tutorial\/3.---------------","identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/3.---------------"},"SkyAssetCache-05.swift":{"highlights":[{"line":68},{"line":69},{"line":70},{"line":71},{"line":72},{"line":73},{"line":74},{"line":75},{"line":76},{"line":77},{"line":78},{"line":79}],"fileType":"swift","content":["import RealityKit","import UIKit","import cloudpractice","","@MainActor","final class SkyAssetCache {","    static let shared = SkyAssetCache()","","    enum State {","        case idle","        case loading","        case ready","        case failed(String)","    }","","    private(set) var state: State = .idle","","    private(set) var skyEntityTemplate: Entity?","    private(set) var cloudATemplate: Entity?","    private(set) var cloudBTemplate: Entity?","","    private var loadingTask: Task<Void, Error>?","","    var isReady: Bool {","        if case .ready = state {","            return true","        }","        return false","    }","","    func preload() async throws {","        if isReady {","            return","        }","","        if let loadingTask {","            try await loadingTask.value","            return","        }","","        state = .loading","","        let task = Task { @MainActor in","            async let skyTexture = TextureResource(named: \"skyBg_ASTC.ktx\")","            async let cloudA = Entity(named: \"Cloud_A\", in: cloudpracticeBundle)","            async let cloudB = Entity(named: \"Cloud_B\", in: cloudpracticeBundle)","","            let (texture, loadedCloudA, loadedCloudB) = try await (","                skyTexture,","                cloudA,","                cloudB","            )","","            var material = UnlitMaterial()","            material.color = .init(tint: .white, texture: .init(texture))","","            let skyMesh = MeshResource.generateSphere(radius: 100)","            let skyEntity = ModelEntity(mesh: skyMesh, materials: [material])","            skyEntity.scale = SIMD3<Float>(-1, 1, 1)","","            skyEntityTemplate = skyEntity","            cloudATemplate = loadedCloudA","            cloudBTemplate = loadedCloudB","            state = .ready","        }","","        loadingTask = task","","        do {","            try await task.value","            loadingTask = nil","        } catch {","            loadingTask = nil","            skyEntityTemplate = nil","            cloudATemplate = nil","            cloudBTemplate = nil","            state = .failed(error.localizedDescription)","            throw error","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","identifier":"SkyAssetCache-05.swift","fileName":"SkyAssetCache.swift","type":"file"},"doc://2026TechMap_tutorial/tutorials/2026TechMap_tutorial/Chapter3-ImmersiveView":{"url":"\/tutorials\/2026techmap_tutorial\/chapter3-immersiveview","estimatedTime":"20min","kind":"project","abstract":[{"text":"캐싱해 둔 하늘과 구름 템플릿을 실제 3D 공간에 배치할 차례입니다. ","type":"text"},{"code":"RealityView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"로","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"사용자를 감싸는 하늘을 만들고, 여러 구름에 서로 다른 모양과 움직임을 부여합니다.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/Chapter3-ImmersiveView","title":"몰입 공간 콘텐츠 구성하기","type":"topic","role":"project"},"doc://2026TechMap_tutorial/tutorials/2026TechMap_tutorial/Chapter4-ContentView#%EC%97%90%EC%85%8B-%EB%A1%9C%EB%94%A9-%EC%83%81%ED%83%9C-UI-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0":{"url":"\/tutorials\/2026techmap_tutorial\/chapter4-contentview#%EC%97%90%EC%85%8B-%EB%A1%9C%EB%94%A9-%EC%83%81%ED%83%9C-UI-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0","kind":"section","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"메인 윈도우는 에셋 준비 상태를 보여주고, 사용자가 버튼으로 몰입 공간을 열고 닫게"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"합니다. 이번 챕터에서는 상태별 UI와 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openImmersiveSpace"},{"text":"·","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dismissImmersiveSpace"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"전환을 차례대로 연결합니다.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/tutorials\/2026TechMap_tutorial\/Chapter4-ContentView#%EC%97%90%EC%85%8B-%EB%A1%9C%EB%94%A9-%EC%83%81%ED%83%9C-UI-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0","title":"에셋 로딩 상태 UI 만들기","